. One can promote brands on their account by creating content that companies can repurpose, such as ads.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p>Finally, whatever method you are going to use to get a steady and constant growth, you must pay attention to a defined audience and get constant engagement from them. Also, these 3 are the best answers to the question: how to get money with Instagram using the best methods.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<\/h3>\n\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel courseOwl\">\n\n                \n                    \n                    <div class=\"course-card card-r rounded-4\">\n\n                        <!-- \u2705 SINGLE MEDIA DIV (FIXED) -->\n                        <div class=\"course-media\"\n                             data-lottie=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/uploads\/images\/courses\/json-images\/digital-marketing.json\"\n                             data-fallback=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/themes\/newwscube\/assets\/imges\/Image.png\">\n                        <\/div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-body\">\n                            <h5>AI-Powered Digital Marketing Course<\/h5>\n\n                            <p class=\"rating\">\n                                4.9 \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n                                (19476)\n                            <\/p>\n\n                            <ul class=\"course-meta\">\n                                <li>\ud83d\udc64 20000 Learners<\/li>\n                                <li>\u23f1 20 Weeks<\/li>\n                            <\/ul>\n\n                            <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                                                                    <a h